---
import Crosshair from "@lucide/astro/icons/crosshair";
import Layers from "@lucide/astro/icons/layers";
import Trophy from "@lucide/astro/icons/trophy";
---

<section class="facts" aria-label="In numbers">
  <p><Crosshair class="icon" /><strong>44</strong> shots on average to sink a randomly placed fleet. The best possible is 17.</p>
  <p><Layers class="icon" /><strong>30 billion</strong> fleet layouts, weighed exactly before every shot.</p>
  <p><Trophy class="icon" /><strong>7 in 10</strong> games won against a careful, human-style player.</p>
</section>

<style>
  .facts {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 32px 48px;
    padding-top: 32px; border-top: 1px solid var(--ink);
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .facts { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } }
  p { margin: 0; color: var(--ink-soft); max-width: 30ch; }
  p :global(.icon) { display: block; width: 30px; height: 30px; stroke-width: 1.5; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 14px; }
  strong {
    display: block; color: var(--ink); font-weight: 500; font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.6vw, 3rem);
    line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 4px; font-variant-numeric: lining-nums;
  }
</style>
